      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1285164910,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Yes, the plan is to add code to [packet_list_model.cpp](ui/qt/models/packet_list_model.cpp) to recolor packets when a time shift or time reference is added, but only if there is a color filter that would be affected, which I think is only when the filter has something with `frame.` Similarly, I would like to use it for packet comments; it's not too bad to just unconditionally recolor when adding a comment to a single frame, but it's possible to add or remove from many packets.\n\nI'm not certain that there's as strong of a use case right away for anything other than frame (or the frame related PINO pkt_comment).\n\n#12519 has some related discussion.",
          "author": {
